            },
            "reviewBody": "Brings something special to the dinner table without any effort. I used a delicious, but potent, spicy honey bbq sauce. It overwhelmed the ranch. Next time, I will do a 2:1 ratio of ranch to bbq. I think this will give it a smoother taste.",
